## 2026-05-11 -Logo Integration

**Task:** Integrate the official logo `z_logo.png`.
**Decision:** Add logo to the Header (alongside the text) and use it as the site's Favicon.
**Alternatives considered:**
- Replace text "ZNote" with logo (rejected by user)
- Logo only in Navbar (rejected by user)
**Reasoning:** User wanted the logo accompanied by the text "ZNote" in the Navbar and used as a favicon. Redimensioning to 48x48 in Navbar for better visibility (increased from 32x32).
