## 2026-05-20 -Retiring Network Labs Category

**Task:** Remove the `network-labs` category and focus the blog on offensive/AI security.
**Decision:** Deleted the `content/network-labs/` directory and its contents (`ipv4-ipv6-addressing.mdx`, `linux-adds.mdx`). Updated Header navigation, home page category cards, and dynamic category page routing validation to exclude `network-labs`. Rewrote author description to focus on offensive/AI security.
**Reasoning:** The user decided that networking architecture was out of place and wanted to concentrate strictly on offensive security/pentesting/CTFs.
**Status:** Active

